  "details": "I have a weird mic bug where everytime I talk in game my voice is stuttering for other players. It wasnt like that before and it only started to happen since the last update. My mic is working perfectly fine if i'm using it on other softwares but lags when using vrchat. I also contacted vrchat staff about it and they told me to report the bug here.  My game runs between 60 to 20 fps and my connection is working perfectly fine. But like I said, before the update, even with low fps or lags, my mic wasnt lagging for others.",
